WEBVTT

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:05.100
Eh...

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.360
Okay, on to the next problem.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.860
Kurosaki, would you please solve it?

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:11.440
Hm?

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.860
Oh, it looks like Kurosaki Mea isn't here today.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.120
Did Kurosaki-san catch a cold?

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:17.910
Nana-chan?

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:18.490
Eh?

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:20.660
No idea.

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.710
I don't really know, either.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.920
I bought cake for Mea, too.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:37.180
She'll be surprised if I show up suddenly to give it to her, won't she?

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:43.140
She seemed kind of down today.

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:45.230
If there's something she's worried about,

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:47.560
she could have spoken to me about it...

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:51.360
Because we're friends.

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:56.200
Damn it!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.160
What are you, a monster?!

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:59.410
W-What's going on...?

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:01.040
Are you going to run away?

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:06.040
I'm even holding back for you, so let's play a little more.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:08.170
Mea...

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:38.280
<b>fushigi na yasuragi kanshou</b>

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:38.280
<b>不思議な安らぎ観賞</b>

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:38.280
<b>This strange feeling of peaceful enjoyment</b>

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:40.870
<b>shibaraku kono mama</b>

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:40.870
<b>しばらくこのまま</b>

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:40.870
<b>Will continue for a while</b>

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:45.450
<b>rikai funou puroburemu bousou</b>

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:45.450
<b>理解不能プロブレム暴走</b>

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:45.450
<b>An impossible to solve problem runs wild</b>

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:48.750
<b>genin wa?</b>

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:48.750
<b>原因は？</b>

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:48.750
<b>And the cause is?</b>

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:55.210
<b>kimi to iru to kudaranai oshie wasureru</b>

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:55.210
<b>君といるとくだらない教え忘れる</b>

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:55.210
<b>Whenever I'm with you, I forget all about these boring lessons</b>

00:01:55.340 --> 00:02:03.010
<b>kono henka kara umaretahonshin ukeireyou</b>

00:01:55.340 --> 00:02:03.010
<b>この変化から生まれた本心受け入れよう</b>

00:01:55.340 --> 00:02:03.010
<b>I want you to accept the true feelings born from this change</b>

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:06.980
<b>harimegutta saisho no kokoro</b>

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:06.980
<b>張り巡った最初の心</b>

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:06.980
<b>I reeled in the first heart I could hook</b>

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:10.440
<b>taguriyose sotto seebushita</b>

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:10.440
<b>手繰り寄せそっとセーブした</b>

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:10.440
<b>Carefully saving it</b>

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:15.070
<b>hyouteki ni fukuzatsu na mune no yami takushite</b>

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:15.070
<b>標的に複雑な胸の闇託して</b>

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:15.070
<b>I use the complicated darkness in my heart on my target</b>

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:18.150
<b>Care me! Care me! Care me! Care me!</b>

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:18.150
<b></b>

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:18.150
<b></b>

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:24.160
<b>naiteru kokoro atatamete yatto kizuita</b>

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:24.160
<b>泣いてる心温めてやっと気づいた</b>

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:24.160
<b>As I warmed the crying heart, I finally realised</b>

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:33.000
<b>watashi no himitsu heiki wa nani yori mo tsuyoku katakumusunda</b>

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:33.000
<b>私の秘密兵器はなによりも強く硬く結んだ</b>

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:33.000
<b>That more than anything, my secret weapon is strongly, firmly bound</b>

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.260
<b>kimi to no tsunagari</b>

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.260
<b>君との繋がり</b>

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.260
<b>With my connection to you</b>

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:47.340
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:47.340
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:47.340
<b>「After a storm comes a calm</b>

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:47.340
<b>「After a storm comes a calm</b>

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:47.340
<b>~Friends~」</b>

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:47.340
<b>~Friends~」</b>

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:51.190
What I heard from Rito-san about yesterday...

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:52.440
Momo-chan.

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:01.200
Nana!

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:05.370
What's that appearance?

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:07.660
Is that trans...?

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.790
T-That's right.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:13.880
This is my true appearance.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:16.800
I am not Kurosaki Mea.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:26.970
I am a second-generation trans weapon, created from Yami-oneechan... Golden Darkness' data, Mea.

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:28.850
A weapon...

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:32.100
Nana-chan, let's stop it.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.560
Stop pretending to be friends.

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.570
Because that's all it is, right?

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:44.070
I was only pretending to be an Earthling under Master's orders.

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:49.080
There's no way a weapon and a person would be able to understand each others' hearts, after all.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.130
How's Nana?

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:06.140
She's been secluded in her room ever since she came home.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.430
She spoke normally to big sister and Mikan-san,

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.680
who don't know about what happened, though.

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:14.900
No way she wouldn't feel down after that.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:21.860
I might have been hoping for it because 
Mikan-san and Yami-san were such close friends.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:27.740
That Nana could become the key to changing Mea-san's heart.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:29.120
But...

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:34.920
When I think of how Nana feels after being rejected as a "pretend friend"...

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:39.000
If it was going to be like this, maybe I should have separated them.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.760
That's not true, Momo.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:45.090
I'm going to go talk to Nana.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.890
Rito-san...

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:51.720
I have to say it to Nana!

00:04:58.270 --> 00:04:59.480
Ouch...

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:03.900
This familiar sensation is...!

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:09.700
No, Rito!

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:14.120
M-My tail is...!

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:14.960
Lala!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:15.920
I'm sorry!

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:17.630
Wait, why are you naked?!

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:18.830
Why...?

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:21.500
Because I just took a shower.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.710
So why are you here, Rito?

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:27.800
I have some business with Nana.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.350
I see.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.260
Thank you, Rito.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:34.680
You want to try to cheer Nana up, right?

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:37.390
It seems something happened between her and Mea-chan.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:39.770
Did you hear about it from Nana?

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:40.860
No.

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:45.990
She told me yesterday she was going out to give cake to Mea.

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:49.530
But after she came home, she didn't say a word about it,

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:50.990
so I became a little worried.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:55.370
The fact that she didn't say anything meant she must not have wanted to talk about it,

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:58.750
so I was a bit hesitant to ask.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:02.290
But since you're here, I'm sure it'll be okay!

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.300
It's fine, so just hurry up and put some clothes on.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.090
Okay!

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:10.850
Oh, Rito.

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:12.680
I think you should bring your shoes.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:13.640
Shoes?

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.060
Yeah.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:18.600
It's true, she's not in her room.

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:19.310
Hm?

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.770
I guess I should go in here...?

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:42.920
W-What is this place?!

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.020
Rito?

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.350
Hey, Dorasuke!

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:01.980
That's not food.

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:04.520
He's someone I know!

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.360
I'm saved...

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:09.450
Good grief...

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:12.450
It's because you came into my digital safari without permission.

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:14.280
Well, even if you say that...

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:16.120
What is this place, anyways?

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:21.370
It's a cyberspace where animals I've befriended live.

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:25.340
Do you mean the animals you call with the D-Dial come from here?

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.000
That's right.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:30.300
In order for the animals to live in a place as much like their home planet as possible,

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:33.140
it simulates various environments and ecosystems.

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:34.430
It's impressive, isn't it?

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:38.220
But why did you come here?

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:41.350
T-There are times when you want to be alone too, aren't there?

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.230
I heard from Momo.

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:48.730
You know about the situation with Mea, right?

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:50.860
Y-Yeah...

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:53.700
I'm sorry, I...

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.370
I was worried.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:08:01.580
Mea said she had an older sister, and yet she lives by herself.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:06.880
I thought maybe there were some complicated
circumstances that she couldn't talk to other people about.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.380
That even if she wouldn't tell me about it now,

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:13.760
maybe if we became closer she would open up to me eventually.

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:18.760
I thought about how I should respond when the time came.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:23.560
I never thought that her big sister would be Yami.

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:26.980
I must have looked like such a fool, not knowing a thing.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:29.650
Nana, that's not-

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:34.660
That's not true?

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:38.160
I-I was earnest.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.740
I really thought we were friends.

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:45.170
But to Mea, it was nothing but an act.

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:48.250
Nana, just once more...

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:49.960
Will you try talking to Mea?

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.420
About what?!

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:53.970
She said it loud and clear.

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.470
<i>Let's stop pretending to be friends.</i>

00:08:56.470 --> 00:09:00.680
Mea didn't think anything of me!

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:02.390
It's enough!

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:03.680
It doesn't matter!

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:06.400
I don't-

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.440
Eh?

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:13.650
Nana, calm down.

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:21.330
Can I ask you one question?

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:25.160
Nana, do you still think of Mea as a friend?

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:28.790
Do you still want to be friends with her?

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:31.710
Of course I still want to be friends!

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:35.380
I wouldn't come to hate her so easily!

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:38.260
But it's impossible.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.640
Mea doesn't have those feelings.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.390
That's not true!

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:45.930
My body came under Mea's control with her trans ability.

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:49.650
At that time, Mea's feelings came flowing into me.

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:50.690
Eh?

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:55.070
Mea's heart was filled with feelings of uneasiness and loneliness.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:59.530
Like she was lost between being a person and a weapon.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:03.490
Certainly, up until now she may have been pretending to be friends.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:07.660
Because Mea was hiding her true self from you, Nana.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:12.250
But that's different now, right?

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.420
But now that her secret's out,

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:17.050
I'm sure you can become closer than before!

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.550
You only have to redo it.

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:24.310
This time without pretending, as real friends.

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:27.680
Real friends...?

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:32.690
I see.

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.440
Rito-san said that?

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:35.320
Yeah.

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.410
Hey, Momo.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:41.370
Hm?

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:44.950
I'm going to try talking to Mea one more time.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:46.790
Yeah!

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:50.040
What is it?

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:50.870
Are you getting dizzy?

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:52.670
Huh?! N-No.

00:10:56.590 --> 00:11:01.260
B-Being hugged feels good, huh?

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:03.760
Yeah.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:07.100
You were hugged by Rito-san, weren't you?

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:08.020
Hugged?!

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:09.520
By that beast?!

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:11.270
H-How could you say tha-

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:14.440
Momo, what are you-?!

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:15.230
Hm?

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:16.530
Nothing much.

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:18.820
A hug from Rito-san?!

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:20.780
He hasn't even done that to me!

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:24.530
You're so cheeky, Nana.

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:31.420
W-Why, you...!

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:33.750
Will you cut it out!

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.930
Looks like she's cheered up.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:43.800
Yeah.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:45.890
As expected of Rito.

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:49.430
Nana.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:51.100
I'll see you later.

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:10.000
So embarrassing.

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:33.600
Mikado.

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:36.150
I'll leave a bathrobe here.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:37.610
Thank you, Tear.

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:41.400
Momo-chan called a little bit ago.

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:45.280
She said Nana-chan is going to try to see Mea-san one more time.

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:46.200
I see.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.280
She's a strong girl.

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.240
Yeah.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.200
Mea-san...

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:58.710
This was the right thing to do, wasn't it, Master?

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:03.720
Our path in life and Nana-chan's are different.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.260
That's right.

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:07.340
A world of battle.

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:10.260
That's my path.

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:15.770
From the start, my friendship with Nana-chan would end when I bring Yami-oneechan back into space.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:18.230
It only ended a little bit more quickly.

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:20.900
That's how it should be, but...

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:24.950
Why do I feel so down?

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.700
Are you going to set it up from this far away?

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:29.740
Don't worry.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:33.500
This tiny little gravity bomb is my trump card.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:37.120
When it goes off, this whole area will become a mountain of rubble in an instant.

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:43.840
If I'm not mistaken, you're...

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:46.430
Mea!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.180
So this is where you were?

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.720
Nana-chan, why?

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:55.430
Despite his appearance, Marimotta has a strong sense of smell.

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:58.810
He remembered your smell from when you played with him before,

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:01.360
so he helped me find you.

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:02.020
Thank you.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:03.400
Not that.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.610
I said it, didn't I?

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:08.110
I'm done pretending to be friends.

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:13.660
I have something to tell you, so listen.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:16.660
Stay away!

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.510
Nana!

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:29.680
Wait, Momo!

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.970
Rito-san, what are you doing at a time like this!

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:32.930
I'm sorry.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:42.770
Why?!

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:44.360
Why won't it hit?!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:47.490
Mea, I'm coming over there.

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:48.900
That's...

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:52.450
That's... a failure for a weapon!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:53.830
Stay away!

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:05.250
What is this place?

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:09.380
Eh? Rito?

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.010
Eh?

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:14.430
Wai-

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:17.310
W-What are you doing?!

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:19.310
Stop it, you beast!

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:20.980
H-Hey!

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:28.650
This...

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:34.990
No! This isn't Rito!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:43.960
That's something I created using a strong image from your heart, Nana-chan.

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:48.420
So it was Rito-senpai who got you to come here?

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:53.800
Is this your trans ability to enter peoples' hearts?

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:57.890
Please, promise me you'll go home.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:01.890
If you do, I'll stop this.

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:03.770
I've remembered it.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:05.940
The feeling of battle.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.230
The world I live in.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:15.240
I'm certain that Master left me alone so that I would understand that.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:19.950
I shouldn't be with you any more, Nana-chan.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:24.960
After all, you're a person and I'm a weapon.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:25.920
So...

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:27.920
That has nothing to do with it.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:28.750
Eh?

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:35.510
Whether you're a weapon or a person... the title doesn't matter!

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:43.770
The thing that's important is our feelings!

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:49.610
Mea, please be my friend again!

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:53.280
Without pretending, as real friends!

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:57.120
Real friends...?

00:16:57.120 --> 00:17:00.950
Let's go to school together again...

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:05.540
Play together... talk about different things...

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:11.090
Eat sweets... and smile together.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.970
Ah... But... I...

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:22.140
I won't forget how Master taught me that I'm a weapon.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:26.100
I don't even know how long I'll be able to stay in this city.

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.690
I told you, didn't I?

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:32.530
Whether it's a person, an animal, or even a weapon doesn't matter to me.

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:36.030
You're just Mea.

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:40.530
Nana-chan...

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.700
What is this...?

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:46.370
It feels like my heart is becoming lighter.

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:49.170
That's not fair.

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:56.590
If you say it like that, there's no way I can turn you down.

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:05.480
It feels like they've taken a step forward.

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:07.140
Who's there?!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:09.690
Eh?

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:16.820
They were getting a little too mischievous, so I took care of them.

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:17.570
Yami!

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:22.660
Momo, I'll leave handing them over to the galaxy police to you.

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:24.080
Ah, yes.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:28.500
I must thank Nana for what she did for Mea.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:31.210
You knew about all of it?

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:33.800
Well, she is my little sister.

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:37.090
Yami-oneechan...?

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:43.310
Onee-chan, you said to me before...

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:47.230
That you wanted me to know about
the warmth of contact with a person.

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:52.440
You said that it was the thing that I needed to understand you, Yami-oneechan.

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:57.940
I... get the feeling that I understand what you meant a little bit, now.

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:03.330
This city is too peaceful, isn't it?

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:04.660
Yes.

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:07.910
There's no battle, and it doesn't smell like blood, either.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:11.120
Those who live here are all strange and naive people.

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:12.290
Strange?

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:16.880
It's strange for weapons like us to be in a place like this, isn't it?

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:18.840
Yes.

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:25.810
But it makes me feel like I want to stay here for a little while longer.

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:29.020
I feel the same.

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:30.640
It's such a bother, isn't it?

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:31.810
Yes.

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:35.270
It's such a bother, this city.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:43.990
Mea.

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:45.700
Master!

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:49.410
Master, um... I...

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.000
Nana-chan...

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:52.290
Don't say anything.

00:19:52.670 --> 00:20:00.720
In fact, I welcome the chance to understand Golden Darkness' heart by your living here.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:04.590
Because we must understand.

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:06.220
Then...!

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:09.430
You may spend your time as you please for the time being.

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:10.140
Yes!

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:15.650
Thanks to you Mea, I'm beginning to understand.

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:19.030
What it is that's leading you astray.

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:22.530
It is certainly an unnecessary feeling for a weapon.

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:26.030
I suppose I can no longer continue to hide myself from people.

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:34.500
I can't sleep.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:40.590
I'm so glad I went to see Mea one more time.

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:43.130
I wonder if it was thanks to that hug from him?

00:20:57.310 --> 00:21:01.440
It was so warm inside his arms.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.950
Thanks for the food.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:14.580
Got it.

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:20.210
I-I'll just sneak into bed with him.

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:37.520
M-Mikan-san!

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:40.110
Rito-san was amazing in his sleep again today-

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:41.900
Wait... Nana?!

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:47.240
What are you doing in the middle of the night, you beast?!

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:49.120
Nana, calm down!

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:51.280
Rito-san was doing it unconsciously!

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:54.450
You damn beast!

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:14.430
<b>niwasaki yureru hana ga tsun to senobi de kotaeru</b>

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:14.430
<b>庭先揺れる花がツンと背伸びで応える</b>

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:14.430
<b>The flower swaying in the garden answers by stretching up</b>

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:20.060
<b>tsumasakidachi de asa ni ohayou no kisu</b>

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:20.060
<b>つま先立ちで朝におはようのKiss</b>

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:20.060
<b>To give a good morning kiss standing on tiptoes</b>

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:22.980
<b>saa yukou</b>

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:22.980
<b>さあ行こう</b>

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:22.980
<b>Now let's go!</b>

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:29.780
<b>fui ni tsumujikaze omowazu shagamikomu</b>

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:29.780
<b>不意につむじ風思わずしゃがみ込む</b>

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:29.780
<b>Caught off guard by the sudden whirlwind, I reflexively crouch down</b>

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:42.090
<b>fuwari sukaato ni kakushita yowasatsuyoku haratte miseta</b>

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:42.090
<b>ふわりスカートに隠した弱さ 強く払ってみせた</b>

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:42.090
<b>I firmly brush off the weakness hidden inside my skirt</b>

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:51.140
<b>fuzoroi de sainan na nichijou ni sakihokorou</b>

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:51.140
<b>不揃いで災難な日常に咲き誇ろう</b>

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:51.140
<b>Let's bloom to our fullest in this strange everyday life full of misfortune</b>

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:59.310
<b>sunao ni sodatanai kara chanto mitenakucha</b>

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:59.310
<b>素直に育たないからちゃんと見てなくちゃ</b>

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:59.310
<b>I can't be honest, so you have to pay close attention</b>

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:07.320
<b>tameratta ano omoi sotto tsuchi ni umetanda</b>

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:07.320
<b>躊躇ったあの想いそっと土に埋めたんだ</b>

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:07.320
<b>I carefully buried the memory of my hesitance in the soil</b>

00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:13.580
<b>A flower blooming in your heart</b>

00:23:13.320 --> 00:23:18.870
<b>sono hi o yume mite</b>

00:23:13.320 --> 00:23:18.870
<b>その日を夢見て</b>

00:23:13.320 --> 00:23:18.870
<b>I dream of that day</b>

